ely new thing and hackers  are exploiting that so you know any  country where their elections and  there's you know widespread use of  social media you know it really requires  voters to rethink you know how they're  interrogating their new sources and  that's a problem that hasn't been solved  yet so you know with that I just wanted  to just want to thank everybody who's  watching again we do this every week you  know 1 p.m. eastern and as always if you  have any questions offline we're more  than happy to its catalog them and try  to answer them in future shows on  twitter i'm at jordan r1000 happy to  taking those questions offline and again  thanks everybody who watch them to  everybody who commented we always  appreciate the engagement and we'll see  we'll see you all next week thanks very  much  [Music]  you  [Music]  you  [Music]

